### Day 16 Exercise 2: Backend Ticket Service Refactor - HTTP Evidence
### Run Spring Boot first: mvn spring-boot:run

### Login as seeded admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}


### Copy token from login response
@token = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE


### ============================================
### 1. CREATE ticket - happy path
### ============================================
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "  Refactor Test Ticket  ",
  "description": "  Testing normalization of input fields  ",
  "category": "  BUG  ",
  "priority": "  high  ",
  "createdBy": "  admin  "
}

### Expected: 201 Created, all fields trimmed, priority = "HIGH", status = "OPEN"


### ============================================
### 2. GET ticket by ID - happy path
### ============================================
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/PASTE_CREATED_TICKET_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected: 200 OK, ticket returned with trimmed fields


### ============================================
### 3. GET ticket by ID - 404 error path
### ============================================
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/nonexistent-id-999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected: 404 Not Found, error message "Ticket nonexistent-id-999 was not found"


### ============================================
### 4. UPDATE ticket - happy path
### ============================================
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/PASTE_CREATED_TICKET_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Updated Refactor Test Ticket",
  "description": "Updated description after refactor",
  "category": "FEATURE",
  "priority": "  low  ",
  "status": "  in_progress  "
}

### Expected: 200 OK, priority = "LOW", status = "IN_PROGRESS", fields trimmed


### ============================================
### 5. UPDATE ticket - invalid priority (error path)
### ============================================
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/PASTE_CREATED_TICKET_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Should Fail",
  "description": "Invalid priority test",
  "category": "BUG",
  "priority": "URGENT",
  "status": "OPEN"
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request, error message about invalid priority


### ============================================
### 6. UPDATE ticket - invalid status (error path)
### ============================================
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/PASTE_CREATED_TICKET_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Should Fail",
  "description": "Invalid status test",
  "category": "BUG",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "RESOLVED"
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request, error message about invalid status


### ============================================
### 7. UPDATE ticket - not found (error path)
### ============================================
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/nonexistent-id-999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Should Fail",
  "description": "Not found test",
  "category": "BUG",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "OPEN"
}

### Expected: 404 Not Found, error message "Ticket nonexistent-id-999 was not found"


### ============================================
### 8. CREATE ticket - invalid priority (error path)
### ============================================
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Bad Priority Ticket",
  "description": "Testing invalid priority on create",
  "category": "BUG",
  "priority": "CRITICAL",
  "createdBy": "admin"
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request, error message about invalid priority


### ============================================
### 9. GET all tickets - verify data integrity
### ============================================
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected: 200 OK, all tickets returned with correct shapes
